models/
# Cached market data. Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `data/`
# matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# both `bot/data/` (the whole provider layer — the repository would not
# import) and `web/data/` (the dashboard's published state). Neither was
# visible locally, because the files were there; only CI saw the repo as
# it actually was.
/data/
